 "strings": {
  "You used the Lucky Hanafuda Card.": "",
  "What difficulty do you wanna play on?": "",
  "Hm? Looks like you don't have enough wooden tags.": "",
  "You need at least 200 points for koi-koi. Go buy some points from the exchange area.": "",
  "This here's where you can play oicho-kabu. You down?": "",
  "Sorry, pal. You gotta have 100 points if you wanna play oicho-kabu.": "",
  "Sounds good. Let's get goin'.": "",
  "I feel you, man. Maybe later, yeah?": "",
  "You used the Trips Yokan.": "",
  "You used the 10-10-1 Charm.": "",
  "(I won't use it just yet...)": "",
  "Which item do you want to use?": "",
  "Looks like you don't have the points. Need at least 1 point for oicho-kabu.": "",
  "Go buy some points from the exchange area.": "",
  "Hey, pal. You need wooden tags? Or are you lookin' to exchange for prizes?": "",
  "What prize you want?": "",
  "There ya go. Come back when you're done rackin' up more points.": "",
  "How much you need? It's 100 yen a point.": "",
  "Go have a blast, buddy.": "",
  "No skin off my back. Just come back n' buy some later, yeah?": "",
  "Hey, pal...? You don't got the cash.": "",
  "Gotcha. Come back later.": "",
  "I'll take 50 points.": "",
  "I'll take 100 points.": "",
  "I'll take 1,000 points.": "",
  "(I'm too poor... Maybe gambling isn't the best idea...)": "",
  "Welcome, sir. You can exchange money for chips at this desk. ": "",
  "How many would you like, sir? ": "",
  "Wonderful. Here are your chips. ": "",
  "Thank you, sir. Here are your 50 chips.": "",
  "Thank you, sir. Here are your 100 chips.": "",
  "Thank you, sir. Here are your 500 chips.": "",
  "Thank you, sir. Here are your 1,000 chips.": "",
  "Thank you, sir. Here are your 10,000 chips.": "",
  "I'm afraid you lack the funds, sir. ": "",
  "Come back soon, sir. ": "",
  "Would you like to purchase chips, sir? Or perhaps exchange chips for prizes?": "",
  "Which prize catches your eye?": "",
  "Very well, sir. We eagerly await your return.": "",
  "Purchasing chips? 1 chip will be 100 yen.": "",
  "Much appreciated, sir. Please enjoy.": "",
  "Very well, sir. Please come again.": "",
  "I'm afraid you lack the funds, sir.": "",
  "I'll take 50.": "",
  "I'll take 100.": "",
  "I'll take 1,000.": "",
  "Sorry, not right now.": "",
  "(I'm too poor to be gambling, I guess.)": "",
  "This is the poker table. Will you be playing with us today?": "",
  "Sure, if you have the room.": "",
  "Very good, sir.": "",
  "Wonderful. The starting bets are as follows: 5 chips for rounds one and two, then 10 chips on rounds three and four.": "",
  "Wonderful. The starting bets are as follows: 50 chips for rounds one and two, then 100 chips on rounds three and four.": "",
  "I'm sorry, sir. You will need at least 100 chips to play at the low rate table. ": "",
  "I'm sorry, sir. You will need at least 1,000 chips to play at the high rate table. ": "",
  "Please buy additional chips.": "",
  "Please take a seat, sir.": "",
  "Sorry, I'm good for now.": "",
  "Very well, sir. Please come back.": "",
  "This is the blackjack table. Will you be playing with us today?": "",
  "Low rate games start from 10 chips a game.": "",
  "High rate games start from 100 chips a game.": "",
  "I'm sorry, sir. You will need at least 10 chips to play at the low rate blackjack table. ": "",
  "I'm sorry, sir. You will need at least 100 chips to play at the high rate blackjack table. ": "",
  "Welcome. You can trade in your cash for chips here.": "",
  "Want to buy some chips?": "",
  "Alright. Hold on a sec. ": "",
  "Here you go, 50 chips. Thanks, have fun.": "",
  "Here you go, 100 chips. Thanks, have fun.": "",
  "Here you go, 500 chips. Thanks, have fun.": "",
  "Here you go, 1000 chips. Thanks, have fun.": "",
  "Here you go, 10000 chips. Thanks, have fun.": "",
  "Hey, looks like you don't have enough cash. ": "",
  "Come back later.": "",
  "Hm? Are you here to buy some chips? Or do you want to trade them in for prizes?": "",
  "What do you want to trade them for?": "",
  "All right. Come back again.": "",
  "Buying chips? That'll be 100 yen for each chip.": "",
  "Thanks. It's not everyday you get to come to the Dragon's Palace. Have fun.": "",
  "I see. Come back again sometime.": "",
  "Hey, it looks like you don't have enough money.": "",
  "All right. Another time.": "",
  "You can play poker here. Wanna join?": "",
  "The starting bets are as follows: 50 chips for rounds one and two, then 100 chips on rounds three and four.": "",
  "Hey, you need at least 100 chips to participate in the low rate poker table.": "",
  "Hey, you need at least 1000 chips to participate in the high rate poker table.": "",
  "Sorry, but can you come back with some chips?": "",
  "Have a seat.": "",
  "I see. Come back again.": "",
  "You can play blackjack here. Wanna join us?": "",
  "That's what I'm talking about.": "",
  "Low rate games start from 10 chips per game.": "",
  "High rate games start from 100 chips per game.": "",
  "Hey, you need at least 10 chips to play low rate blackjack.": "",
  "Hey, you need at least 100 chips to play high rate blackjack.": "",
  "Sorry but come back when you have additional chips.": "",
  "Al lright, have a seat.": "",
  "Oh yeah? Another time then.": "",
  "You down for shogi?": "",
  "If you say so. Well, lemme know if you ever change your mind.": "",
  "Hm? Well if it isn't the shogi king himself. Down for some shogi?": "",
  "Come back again. I'll be around.": "",
  "Oh. Is Shintani-sensei not here?": "",
  "Beats me. What do you need him for?": "",
  "Just wanted to ask him about something. I'll try back later.": "",
  "Hold on a sec...": "",
  "You plan on twiddling your thumbs until Shintani comes back? Are you bored?": "",
  "Well... I can't say I'm busy.": "",
  "Good. Then I've got the perfect job for you.": "",
  "I have a client who needs a bodyguard, and I want you to fill the post, Yagami.": "",
  "A bodyguard? What kind of clients are you taking these days?": "",
  "Oh, it's just a messy custody battle that's going to court. I'm representing the mother.": "",
  "Her name's Azusa Otaki, and her daughter is Karin.": "",
  "They're set to appear in domestic affairs court today, and I'd like you to protect them until they get there.": "",
  "Who do they need protection <font_kind=yakuza_italic>from</font_kind>?": "",
  "Apparently the father was yakuza until very recently.": "",
  "The way she tells it, she got into a huge fight with him and had to flee with her daughter.": "",
  "So you're giving her a bodyguard just because he's ex-yakuza? Isn't that kind of an overreaction?": "",
  "This poor woman doesn't seem to think so. She said her husband would do anything to get his daughter back.": "",
  "Her husband's name is Jin Otaki. It might not even come to it, but can you protect them from him if it does?": "",
  "All right, seems pretty clear. Who knows when Shintani-sensei will be back anyway, so I guess I'll help.": "",
  "Sorry. I'll pay you.": "",
  "By the way... Ever heard of Shunei Oikawa, the lawyer?": "",
  "Oikawa? No, don't think I have.": "",
  "He's representing the father. But he's formerly one of mine.": "",
  "Huh? He worked here?": "",
  "Yeah, he was gone before you started. One of those elite types who passed the Bar real early in life.": "",
  "But he wanted to win his cases by any means necessary... Even bribery or blackmail.": "",
  "Yeah? I'm surprised I haven't heard of him, then.": "",
  "He was good. Had some real potential.": "",
  "That's why I came down hard on him about changing his ways... But he didn't give a damn.": "",
  "In the end, I had no choice. I fired him. I thought maybe that would be the wake-up call he needed.": "",
  "But all it did was give him a chip on his shoulder. I swear, the man only lives to beat me now.": "",
  "Out of revenge for firing him or something?": "",
  "Yeah, but living for revenge just makes you sloppy. He'll probably never learn.": "",
  "...Anyway. Do you know where this mother and her daughter are now?": "",
  "They were here not long ago, actually. She said they had some shopping to do, and I couldn't stop her.": "",
  "For being her legal council, she doesn't seem to want to take my advice.": "",
  "Sounds like a lovely family. Any idea where they might've gone?": "",
  "She said something about getting some clothes to make themselves presentable in court...": "",
  "So somewhere with clothes, huh? All right, I'll go find her.": "",
  "(Is the wife I'm supposed to be protecting here?)": "",
  "(Oh. That must be her.)": "",
  "Excuse me, Ma'am. Are you Azusa Otaki?": "",
  "I'm Yagami. Genda-sensei asked me to look after you today.": "",
  "Is your daughter around?": "",
  "No. I didn't.": "",
  "(Is she lost? That's not good. She's an easy target for the husband if she's alone.)": "",
  "I'll go look for her. Stay here, in case she comes back.": "",
  "(Maybe someone around here saw something. I should ask around.)": "",
  "(Her... She looks like Karin-chan in this photo.)": "",
  "You're Karin Otaki, aren't you?": "",
  "Who are you, mister?": "",
  "My name's Yagami. Genda-sensei hired me to look after you and your mother, and she lost track of you.": "",
  "So Mom suddenly cares about me? I'm big enough to do what I want, so leave me alone.": "",
  "Uh, I can't do that...": "",
  "If Mom and Dad want to get divorced, fine. I wish I could just go live by myself.": "",
  "(Is she really that nonchalant about the divorce...?)": "",
  "Karin? What are you doing here?": "",
  "Oh, Daddy. I was looking for you.": "",
  "You were? You sure you should be doing that? Your mother would be pretty upset if she found out.": "",
  "Hmph. I don't care.": "",
  "(Hm, for a former yakuza who'd \"do anything\" to get his daughter back, he doesn't seem too desperate.)": "",
  "Um, Dad... I wanted to give you something.": "",
  "Karin, stop! What do you think you're doing, wandering off like that!?": "",
  "Huh? I told you I was going for a walk, and you said okay!": "",
  "W-Well, I must not have heard you right!": "",
  "Come on, Azusa. You really want to go through with taking full custody of Karin in this divorce?": "",
  "I couldn't be more serious. Karin would never reach her full potential with you around. I'm going to raise her right.": "",
  "L-Like you have any right to say that! I'm her father, and I—": "",
  "Come on, Karin. We need to be getting back to Genda-sensei.": "",
  "I told you... Get a divorce for all I care.": "",
  "What do you think you're doing, young lady!? I said, let's go!": "",
  "She sure as hell doesn't hold anything back.": "",
  "(Karin-chan threw something away, didn't she?)": "",
  "(A ticket... to a circus? Was this what she was trying to give her father?)": "",
  "(I'm going to hold onto this for her until she's calmed down.)": "",
  "(They're going back to the office, I think. I better get after them.)": "",
  "Excuse me... Have you seen this child? I can't seem to find her.": "",
  "Hm? Oh, I think I saw her earlier.": "",
  "You did!?": "",
  "Yeah, she was strolling toward Nakamichi Street.": "",
  "Toward Nakamichi Street. Thank you!": "",
  "I think this is the wrong direction.": "",
  "Huh? You...": "",
  "Aren't you Karin-chan's father? Why are you here?": "",
  "Hm. This place hasn't changed at all. Still in desperate need of a cleaning crew.": "",
  "Oikawa... What the hell do you want?": "",
  "(Oikawa? That's the father's attorney, if I recall. And Genda-sensei's former apprentice.)": "",
  "No need to be prickly, Genda-sensei. I'm only here to put an offer on the table.": "",
  "An offer?": "",
  "A settlement. Don't you think these two are capable of an amicable custody decision outside the courts?": "",
  "Of course, that would be to everyone's benefit, but...": "",
  "Hey, I have no intention of handing my daughter over to him!": "",
  "Oh really? Perhaps you'll reconsider after you see this.": "",
  "And this.": "",
  "How did you get these photos, Oikawa?": "",
  "My client suspected his wife might be cheating on him, and hired a private investigator.": "",
  "Cheating!? That guy was just a salesman. It was nothing lurid.": "",
  "He offered to buy me a drink, and I accepted. It was completely innocent.": "",
  "I'm afraid lies don't hold much weight in court, Ma'am.": "",
  "Here's a slightly more... decisive photo.": "",
  "W-What... What's going, Otaki-san?": "",
  "What is this!? I-I don't know anything about this! I went home after a few drinks, I swear!": "",
  "I'm afraid the photo is a clear contradiction of that, Ma'am. Is your memory foggy?": "",
  "According to the PI, you were rather drunk.": "",
  "Damn... I admit, I wasn't expecting pictures like this to turn up.": "",
  "N-No! This is a setup! It has to be!": "",
  "A setup?": "",
  "It couldn't be a coincidence that this man appeared right before my trial! And I'm sure his contact info is bogus too! ": "",
  "Besides, I can hold my liquor just fine, and I found it strange that I felt so drunk that night!": "",
  "I can only imagine that I was drugged! This is some kind of elaborate trap!": "",
  "(That's a typical scheme to pull on a guy, but I suppose it would work on a woman, too. Would Oikawa stoop this low?)": "",
  "Again, it's just an option on the table that you may want to consider before we go to trial.": "",
  "With evidence like this, I have my doubts your client would win the custody battle.": "",
  "And if we can prove infidelity, we could even end up asking for damages.": "",
  "What are you getting at? Spit it out.": "",
  "My client is not heartless, Genda-sensei. Give him full custody, and there won't be any damages to pay.": "",
  "You're as dirty as you've always been, Oikawa. I'm going to guess the \"salesman\" was your plant?": "",
  "Just give my client custody. All she needs to do is sign the newest draft of the divorce papers.": "",
  "Don't you understand, Genda-sensei? You've already lost. Checkmate.": "",
  "Lost? Trials aren't conducted by pieces on a board, Oikawa.": "",
  "Tch. So says the king about to be toppled. What's the point of a battle if you aren't out to win?": "",
  "Please, Genda-sensei! I didn't do this! You believe me, don't you!?": "",
  "I want to, but...": "",
  "(If this was a setup, maybe I could trace it back to some evidence.)": "",
  "(...Seems like it's worth putting in the time.)": "",
  "I'm stepping out for a bit, Genda-sensei. Don't let anyone sign any papers just yet.": "",
  "...Yagami? All right.": "",
  "(I should start with the love hotel this woman claims she never went to.)": "",
  "This is the love hotel where that picture was supposedly taken.": "",
  "Can I help you, sir? Are you here alone?": "",
  "Oh, yeah. You work here?": "",
  "Yeah, I'm the receptionist. Oh, I see. You're the contact, right?": "",
  "The contact?": "",
  "Well, it doesn't matter who you are. Give me 100,000 yen and I'll delete the footage.": "",
  "Uh, I think you must have the wrong guy. I'm Yagami, from Yagami Detective Agency.": "",
  "You're a detective?": "",
  "Yeah, I'm on a case right now, and I'd like to ask a few questions, if I could.": "",
  "Dammit. Forget I said anything. I gotta hurry.": "",
  "Hey, old geezer!": "",
  "Oh, there you are! You're late.": "",
  "(Wait... This guy...)": "",
  "(The man in the picture...)": "",
  "What do you mean you haven't deleted the security footage yet!?": "",
  "I already paid you! You said you would delete it if I gave you the money!": "",
  "Heh, sorry, but my pockets seem to have holes in 'em. Better make it double.": "",
  "D-Don't fuck with me, old man! You delete that shit right now, or I'll fuckin' kill you!": "",
  "Hey! You know Azusa Otaki, don't you?": "",
  "Just tell me if you were really here with Azusa Otaki.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
